    "sentence_translations": [
      "Hope",
      "",
      "The next morning, Little Wu was very tired. He went home.",
      "He sat at home, thinking about the Peach Colony.",
      "Did I really misinterpret what I saw? Are there really no peach trees and small mountains?",
      "",
      "There were some peach blossoms in the room. They were very beautiful.",
      "They were the blossoms that the child gave to him in the Peach Colony.",
      "These were the peach blossoms of the Peach Colony.",
      "",
      "He looked at the peach blossoms and said with a smile, ..",
      ".. “I didn’t make a mistake! The peach trees and the small mountains are real, and the Peach Colony is also real.”",
      "",
      "He called Mi Lai again and said, ..",
      ".. “There are some people that we don’t know about. They live happily, and they are good people.",
      "I think that your child has already gone to them at that place.",
      "Although we can’t see him anymore, he can live well there.”",
      "",
      "Afterword: Chinese people all know about the Peach Colony.",
      "Although we can’t go there or even find it, Chinese people believe that the Peach Colony is hope.",
      ""
